{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>EyvorFPS \u2013 The Fast-Paced, Brutal, No-Nonsense FPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EyvorFPS</strong> is a first-person shooter built for adrenaline junkies. Dive into ultra-fast battles, wield a devastating arsenal, and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Pure Action, Precise Shooting:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense, no-frills gameplay:</strong> Reflexes, accuracy, speed. There's no room for mistakes here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse arsenal:</strong> Pistols, assault rifles, snipers, explosives \u2013 each weapon has its own feel and strategic edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic maps:</strong> Arenas designed for movement, tactical angles, and close-quarters combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic game modes:</strong> Deathmatch, Team Elimination, Domination \u2013 solo or online against other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758990/extras/Screenshot_1.png?t=1748308147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>No Gimmicks. Just Shooting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EyvorFPS</strong> cuts straight to the chase: put a weapon in your hands and throw you into high-octane battles where only the best survive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758990?t=1748308147","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758990?t=1748308147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758990/6d3e4d9c4159cc7104966d0b04c6f16b65e0fed7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748308147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758990/6d3e4d9c4159cc7